  or acronyms, such as UDP. Verify that each technical term has a page
  in the glossary. Verify that the first mention of each technical term
  on any page is hyperlinked to that glossary page.

  Make a list of technical terms that do not have a glossary page and
  add this to WHATNOW as future work to do.

  For any technical term on a page that is not hyperlinked to its
  glossary page, link it. Upon encountering a technical term on a page
  for the first time, a reader should always be able to follow a
  hyperlink to a glossary page to see the definition and relevant
  information to ensure they understand the technical term."

